{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC does not include any additional in-game content.<br>It is sold solely as a way to offer voluntary support to the developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a token of appreciation, the following high-resolution artwork is included:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stray Savior main artwork (store capsule version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Final boss illustration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All supporter DLC for <i>Stray Savior</i> exists solely to support Gustav\u2019s ongoing game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This policy will also apply to future titles developed by Gustav.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you sincerely for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will continue to do our best to create better games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717220?t=1746753003","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717220?t=1746753003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717220/406a070eedeb3c4ece4307f6556eea339a638828/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746753003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717220/406a070eedeb3c4ece4307f6556eea339a638828/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746753003","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC does not include any additional in-game content.<br>It is sold solely as a way to offer voluntary support to the developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a token of appr